# Pocket Copilot Review

Also read:
- `../../references/spec-compliance-checklist.md`
- `../../references/code-quality-checklist.md`

Goal:
- review an existing `pocket-copilot` change in two phases
- run phase 1 first, then phase 2 only if phase 1 passes
- keep the output explicitly split by phase
- return a clear PASS / FAIL conclusion
